SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                1000
NumberOfInitializationCycles  100
PrintEvery                    100

Forcefield                    local
ChargeMethod                  Ewald
EwaldPrecision                1e-6
CutOffVDW                     12.8
